<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dutch first division</p>
<p>soccer played on Saturday:</p>
<p>AZ Alkmaar 0 Fortuna Sittard 1 (Jeffrey 20th). Halftime 0-1.</p>
<p>Attendance 6,900.</p>
<p>Roda JC Kerkrade 3 (Van Hoogdalem 16th, Vand Houdt 60th,</p>
<p>Roelofsen 86th penalty) Volendam 0. Halftime 1-0. Attendance</p>
<p>5,000</p>
<p>Feyenoord Rotterdam 4 (Sanchez 7th, Taument 70th, Vos 75th,</p>
<p>Larsson 85th) Willem II Tilburg 1 (Van der Vegt 48th). Halftime</p>
<p>1-0. Attendance 26,100.</p>
<p>Played on Friday:</p>
<p>Groningen 1 (Gorre 82nd) Heerenveen 5 (Hansma 32nd, Wouden</p>
<p>47th, 59th, Dahl Tomasson 54th penalty, Talan 68th). Halftime</p>
<p>0-1. Attendance 13,000</p>
</text>
